'''Crown''' can refer to any of the following

== Collectibles ==
* {{i|Crown Of Light}} A passive collectible that gives isaac a 2x damage multiplier at full health
* {{i|Dark Prince's Crown}} A passive collectible that gives Isaac a boost to his tears at exactly one red heart of health
* {{i|Glitched Crown}} A passive collectible that makes all future items cycle between 5 different items

== Trinkets ==
* {{t|Bloody Crown}} A trinket that cause item rooms to spawn in [[The Womb]]
* {{t|Cracked Crown}} A trinket that exaggerates Isaac's stat boosts
* {{t|Devil's Crown}} A trinket that replaces item rooms with Devil Deals
* {{t|Holy Crown}} A trinket that causes an item room and shop to spawn in [[Cathedral|The Cathedral]]
* {{t|Wicked Crown}} A trinket that causes an item room and shop to spawn in [[Sheol]]

